String field returns reversed text when deserializing

#### Description

When using the String field to deserialize text values, the output is unexpectedly reversed. This affects all string deserialization operations including nested schemas and field validation.

#### Steps/Code to Reproduce

```python
from marshmallow import Schema, fields

class UserSchema(Schema):
    name = fields.String()
    email = fields.String()

schema = UserSchema()
result = schema.load({'name': 'John', 'email': 'john@example.com'})
print(result)
# Expected: {'name': 'John', 'email': 'john@example.com'}
# Actual: {'name': 'nhoJ', 'email': 'moc.elpmaxe@nhoj'}
```

